curl: (52) Empty reply from server
```

that is extremly simple to trigger

it confirms a DoS in the HTTP/2 session cache, that needs be patched, the impact is will lead the server crashes and shutdown by an attacker, the server is written properly and no flaws in it and try catch blocks and errors handled however because that is an axios internal error will crash
